OL,3,CHundreds of fans line the streets to
OL,4,Cpay tribute to Bonnie Tyler
OL,6,FHundreds of people have lined the
OL,7,Fstreets in Mumbles to pay tribute to
OL,8,FBonnie Tyler as her hearse is driven
OL,9,Fto her home.
OL,11,FThe Total Eclipse of the Heart singer,
OL,12,Fborn Gaynor Hopkins, died in a
OL,13,FPortuguese hospital on July 8 at the
OL,14,Fage of 75.
OL,16,FOn Saturday, August 15, members of the
OL,17,Fpublic lined Newton Road in Mumbles as
OL,18,Fthe cortege travels from William
OL,19,FPressdee Funeral care in Mumbles,
OL,20,Freturning to her home in Llwynderw.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/4
