OL,3,CHundreds of fans line the streets to
OL,4,Cpay tribute to Bonnie Tyler
OL,6,FSome fans had travelled from as far as
OL,7,FAustria to watch the procession pass
OL,8,Fthrough the Mumbles.
OL,10,FAs well as lining the streets, some
OL,11,Ffans were waiting outside her home on
OL,12,Fnearby Mumbles Road, with floral
OL,13,Ftributes laid outside the property.
OL,15,FA celebration of Bonnie's life, for
OL,16,Ffamily and friends, will take place at
OL,17,FSwansea Minster on Monday, before the
OL,18,Fsinger makes a final journey through
OL,19,Fher hometown of Skewen.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/4
