OL,3,CHundreds of fans line the streets to
OL,4,Cpay tribute to Bonnie Tyler
OL,6,FTyler's death came just months after
OL,7,Fshe was treated in intensive care
OL,8,Fafter being placed in an induced coma
OL,9,Ffollowing an emergency intestinal
OL,10,Fsurgery.
OL,12,FThe singer achieved international fame
OL,13,Fin the 1980s with the release of Total
OL,14,FEclipse Of The Heart, which shot to
OL,15,Fthe top of the charts in the UK and
OL,16,Fthe US.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/4
