OL,3,CHundreds of fans line the streets to
OL,4,Cpay tribute to Bonnie Tyler
OL,6,FFaster Than The Speed Of Night, the
OL,7,Falbum which featured the track, was
OL,8,Falso a chart-topping success and
OL,9,Flanded the singer her only UK number
OL,10,Fone album.
OL,12,FRecognisable for her husky voice,
OL,13,FTyler released many other hits,
OL,14,Fincluding Holding Out For A Hero, It's
OL,15,FA Heartache and If You Were A Woman
OL,16,F(And I Was A Man).
OL,18,FShe represented the UK in the 2013
OL,19,FEurovision Song Contest in Malmo,
OL,20,FSweden, with the song Believe In Me,
OL,21,Ffinishing in 19th place.
